# Database Rules

Supabase/PostgreSQL is the durable source of truth.
Schema changes require migrations.
Never rewrite migration history.
Every new persistent entity requires ownership strategy, indexes, foreign keys, timestamps and RLS policy where applicable.
Use PostGIS for geographic operations.
Avoid JSONB for core relational data.
